OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,6,Fpreceded by some wet snow on the
OL,7,Fhighest ground though remaining as
OL,8,Fsnow on Argyll Hills. Rain turning
OL,9,Fheavier later. The Ayrshire coast may
OL,10,Fsee a few drier spells. Fresh to
OL,11,Fstrong southeasterly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain carrying on into the
OL,14,Fevening, turning lighter further west
OL,15,Fand becoming drier for the Argyll
OL,16,Fcoast and islands by morning, lighter
OL,17,Fwinds too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
