OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter
OL,6,Frain on Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,7,Fdrier through the afternoon for most
OL,8,Fareas apart from Argyll where patchy
OL,9,Frain may linger.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith bright spells on Thursday but
OL,13,Fwinds strengthening and rain spreading
OL,14,Fin later. Wet on Friday, wintry again
OL,15,Fover hills. Turning brighter but cold
OL,16,Fagain Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
